    Add failing regression tests for PR #33 review round 3
    
    Finding 1: a backslash followed by a literal control character (code
    points 0..31) in a catalog string must be rejected as MalformedJson.
    
    Finding 2: mutation-check.sh --selftest-compile-fault must work when the
    script has mode 644 and must require a fresh baseline run, the injected
    compile fault and child status 2. The tests run the real script in a
    hermetic temp-dir fixture (git repo, stub gradlew, synthetic verifier
    source); no real Gradle is started. Launch-failure controls replace the
    child launch line with `sh -c 'exit N'` for N in 126, 127, 1, 0 and 2.
    
    Tests only; production code and scripts are unchanged.
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

